ex:Ev_Page_Ch03 a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Checks for Page Ch03"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage ;
    backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC_Chapter ; backlog:evidenceVerified true ; backlog:hasTestId "Page/Ch03" ;
    backlog:hasTestSpec "08-tooling/sen0414_page_test_v9_5_0.py exercised every widget and feature of the chapter 3 page in headless Chromium: 37 of 37 widgets and 50 of 50 features passed, every executable example printed via Pyodide exactly what the build interpreter printed, 0 console errors, 0 WCAG 2 AA violations. The pedagogy stage's automated gates (wcag, model provenance, assessment rigor, Bloom coverage) pass. The Courseware profile's pedagogical-soundness attestation is the owner's, is not part of this story's definition of done, and is recorded as pending, not claimed. RDODI Stage 4: parse, shapes (0 violations) and source validity pass; the proposed coverage and substance gates and the navigation gate fail on this page exactly as on the published chapter 2 page - recorded in Finding_Stage4ProposedGatesOnPublishedPages, not claimed as passed. The page's own built-in checks and the Bloom gate each found a defect in the first build - a concept section retrieval misranked, an objective assessed a level below its own - and both were fixed (findings Finding_RetrievalNamesItself and Finding_BloomCoverageObjectiveFour). One test run met a rate limit (HTTP 429) on the embedding model's host and was repeated; the failing run is not counted." ; backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Gates run over the artefacts as published in the release carrying the chapter 3 page (sen0414-v2.28.0)." ;
    backlog:verifiedByTool "08-tooling/sen0414_page_test_v9_5_0.py in headless Chromium; rdodi-ecosystem/07-pedagogy-professional-stage/02-gates/enriched_acceptance_v1_0_0.py; RDODI Stage 4 gates" ; backlog:verifiedAt "2026-09-28T21:29:17"^^xsd:dateTime .
