    backlog:hasTestSpec "08-tooling/sen0414_page_test_v9_5_1.py exercised every widget and feature of the chapter 4 page in headless Chromium: 41 of 41 widgets and 50 of 50 features passed, every executable example printed via Pyodide exactly what the build interpreter printed, 0 console errors, 0 WCAG 2 AA violations - and a fixture with one stored example result altered was refused (widget NoneValue and three features failed). The pedagogy stage's automated gates (wcag, model provenance, assessment rigor, Bloom coverage over five objectives, each with an Apply-level question) pass. The Courseware profile's pedagogical-soundness attestation is the owner's, is not part of this story's definition of done, and is recorded as pending, not claimed. RDODI Stage 4: parse, shapes (0 violations) and source validity pass; the proposed coverage and substance gates fail on this page exactly as on the published chapter 2 and 3 pages - recorded in Finding_Stage4ProposedGatesOnPublishedPages, not claimed as passed. The first run of the page checks found three gaps, none in the content: the shared test clicked a hidden concept link, the template had no icons for nine of the chapter's ten agents, and the taxonomy had no example for the evaluation-steps view - fixed in test 9.5.1, template 9.5.1 and the research data (finding Finding_Ch04PageChecksThreeGaps)." ; backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Gates run over the artefacts as published in the release carrying the chapter 4 page (sen0414-v2.29.0)." ;
