ex:Ev_Page_Ch05 a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Checks for Page Ch05"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage ;
    backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC_Chapter ; backlog:evidenceVerified true ; backlog:hasTestId "Page/Ch05" ;
    backlog:hasTestSpec "08-tooling/sen0414_page_test_v9_7_0.py exercised the chapter 5 page 9.7.0 in headless Chromium: 55 of 55 checks and 54 of 54 widgets passed, including the 8 chapter visualisations - the loop trace; five debugger simulators, with breakpoints set and cleared, Continue landing on the next breakpoint, Step In reaching the end, and Step Over and Step Out landing where the recorded call depths say; the logging-level matrix at each of its 7 settings, shown counts and printed lines matching the specification; and the exception climb ending in the handler - drawn from the same executed specifications as the deck; the Lecture tab with its 37 slide texts and jumps; the Resources tab with 14 checked links and 32 labelled searches; the fitted work area at 1400x900 and 1280x720; 0 console errors, 0 WCAG 2 AA violations. Every executable example printed via Pyodide exactly what the build interpreter printed. A fixture with one stored example result altered was refused by three checks. 32 widgets recorded, all tested. Acceptance @ Courseware: wcag, model provenance, assessment rigor (11 items, every objective assessed), Bloom coverage and over-claim pass; the pedagogical-soundness attestation, the owner's, is pending and not claimed. RDODI Stage 4: parse, shapes and source validity pass; the proposed coverage and substance gates and the navigation gate fail on this page exactly as on the published chapter 3 and 4 pages, and are not claimed. The first build was refused by the acceptance gate (objective CO1 had no quiz item) and the first browser run found an example that printed differently in the browser; both fixed before closing (findings Finding_Ch05FirstPageRefused, Finding_Ch05VersionDependentExample)." ; backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Gates run over the artefacts as published in the release carrying the chapter 5 page 9.7.0 (sen0414-v2.31.0)." ;
    backlog:verifiedByTool "08-tooling/sen0414_page_test_v9_10_0.py in headless Chromium; rdodi-ecosystem/07-pedagogy-professional-stage/02-gates/enriched_acceptance_v1_0_0.py; RDODI Stage 4 gates" ; backlog:verifiedAt "2026-09-29T08:09:01"^^xsd:dateTime .
