    backlog:hasTestSpec "Page 9.11.0 of chapter 6 (template 9.11.0, made from 9.10.0 by 08-tooling/template_patch_v9_11_0.py): 08-tooling/sen0414_page_test_v9_11_0.py passed in headless Chromium: 82 of 82 widgets and 76 features, no console errors, WCAG 2 AA clean, longest main-thread task under 100 ms. The 24 chapter visualisations, including the 13 new kinds, were checked against their specifications through the drawn page. All 99 written bank items were re-run where they carry code in the page's own Python, and the question builder covers all 58 concepts. A fixture with one stored example result altered was refused by three checks. 81 widgets recorded (record builder 2.5.0), all tested. Acceptance @ Courseware: web accessibility, model provenance, assessment rigour (11 items, every objective assessed) and Bloom coverage pass; the pedagogical-soundness attestation, the owner's, is pending and not claimed. RDODI Stage 4: parse, shapes and source validity pass; the proposed coverage and substance gates and the navigation gate fail as on the pages of chapters 3 to 5, and are not claimed. Chapter 5 was rebuilt on 9.11.0 and passes with two added checks; chapters 1 to 4 stay on 9.10.0." ; backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Gates run over the artefacts as published in sen0414-v2.35.0." ;
