    backlog:hasTestSpec "08-tooling/sen0414_page_test_v9_6_0.py exercised the chapter 3 page 9.6.0 in headless Chromium: 50 of 50 checks passed, including 14 of 14 chapter visualisations - loop traces stepped through every pass of every run, number lines with one dot per value and the stop marker, pairs, and the star-import count - drawn from the same executed specifications as the deck; 51 widgets recorded, all tested; 0 console errors, 0 WCAG 2 AA violations. A fixture with one stored example result altered was refused by three checks. Acceptance @ Courseware: wcag, model provenance, assessment rigor, Bloom coverage and over-claim pass; the pedagogical-soundness attestation, the owner's, is pending and not claimed. The Stage 4 navigation gate fails as it did on page 9.5.0 (same patterns), and is not claimed." ; backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Checks run over the artefacts as published in sen0414-v2.30.0." ;
    backlog:verifiedByTool "08-tooling/sen0414_page_test_v9_6_0.py in headless Chromium; rdodi-ecosystem/07-pedagogy-professional-stage/02-gates/enriched_acceptance_v1_0_0.py; RDODI Stage 4 gates" ; backlog:verifiedAt "2026-09-29T06:27:32"^^xsd:dateTime .
