ex:Ev_Live a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Checks for A live-model question in the chapter 5 page's question builder"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage ;
    backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC_Chapter ; backlog:evidenceVerified true ; backlog:hasTestId "Live/Ch05" ;
    backlog:hasTestSpec "Page 9.10.0, 'Ask the live model': tested with a stand-in for the language model that returns chosen replies, because the model needs WebGPU and headless Chromium here has none. Checked: a well-formed reply is shown with the label 'Written by the live model'; a reply with code is shown only when the code, run in the page, prints the marked answer (a wrong marked answer is refused with the reason); a reply that is not a question and one with repeated options are refused; with no model the button says so and nothing else changes. Not observed: a real model's questions, their quality, or the time a small model takes. Acceptance @ Courseware on the page and its ABox: web accessibility, model provenance, assessment rigour and Bloom coverage pass; the attestation is pending, not claimed." ; backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Checks run over the artefacts as published in sen0414-v2.34.0." ;
    backlog:verifiedByTool "08-tooling/sen0414_page_test_v9_10_0.py in headless Chromium, with a stand-in for the language model" ; backlog:verifiedAt "2026-09-29T12:11:43"^^xsd:dateTime .
