    backlog:hasTestSpec "Decks of chapters 1 to 4 as new versions (chapter 1 1.0.2, chapter 2 1.0.2, chapter 3 2.0.1, chapter 4 1.0.1): 08-tooling/ch05-deck/ooxml_fix_v1_0_0.py removed 20, 23, 25 and 7 misplaced paragraph-properties elements; structure_check_v1_0_0.py found 0 afterwards; every run text and speaker note read back equal to the released deck's, slide counts unchanged, and deck_check_v1_0_1.py re-ran the same examples with 0 mismatches. That PowerPoint opens them without repair is inferred from the schema order, not observed. Pages of chapters 1 to 5 rebuilt on template 9.10.0 (page 9.10.0 each, page ABoxes of chapters 1 to 4 as new files 1.1.0): sen0414_page_test_v9_10_0.py passed in headless Chromium for chapter 1 (35 of 35 widgets), 2 (37 of 37), 3 (51 of 51), 4 (41 of 41) and 5 (54 of 54), each with every check of the template and no console errors, WCAG 2 AA clean. Acceptance @ Courseware on the page and its ABox: web accessibility, model provenance, assessment rigour and Bloom coverage pass; the attestation is pending, not claimed. The stale-result fixture was run for chapter 5 only." ; backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Checks run over the artefacts as published in sen0414-v2.34.0." ;
