ex:Ev_Return a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Checks for Written question banks for the chapter 1 to 4 pages, and those pages on template 9.11.0"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage ;
    backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC_Chapter ; backlog:evidenceVerified true ; backlog:hasTestId "Return/Ch05" ;
    backlog:hasTestSpec "Written question banks for chapters 1 to 4 (61, 54, 69 and 74 items; every concept of each chapter has at least one; 13, 22, 26 and 23 programs run under Python 3.14.4 and, in each bank's checker, under 3.11, 3.12 and 3.13 with the same output; each checker was shown to fail when one marked answer is flipped) and the pages of chapters 1 to 4 rebuilt on template 9.11.0 with them: sen0414_page_test_v9_11_1.py passed in headless Chromium on all four (33, 32, 37 and 41 concepts; every written item with code re-run in the page's own Python with no mismatch; no console errors; WCAG 2 AA clean). The stale-result fixture was run for all four and refused the three features it should (for chapter 3 after every stored output was altered, see the findings). Page ABoxes of chapters 1 to 4 as new files (1.2.0); acceptance @ Courseware: web accessibility, model provenance, assessment rigour and Bloom coverage pass, the attestation is pending, not claimed. Stage 4 gates: coverage, substance and hybrid chains fail as on every chapter; not claimed." ; backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Checks run over the artefacts as published in sen0414-v2.36.0." ;
    backlog:verifiedByTool "08-tooling/ch0N-page/question_bank_check_v1_0_0.py (N = 1 to 4) under Python 3.14.4; 08-tooling/sen0414_page_test_v9_11_1.py in headless Chromium on all four pages; 08-tooling/sen0414_rdodi_gates_v1_1_1.py" ; backlog:verifiedAt "2026-09-29T17:53:58"^^xsd:dateTime .
