ex:Ev_Grow a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Checks for Progress, review, links, notes, cheat sheet, marks and code exercises on the pages of chapters 1 to 6"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage ;
    backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC_Chapter ; backlog:evidenceVerified true ; backlog:hasTestId "Grow/Ch05" ;
    backlog:hasTestSpec "Page template 9.13.0 and the pages of chapters 1 to 6 rebuilt on it: progress (mark a section understood, count in the title bar, ticks and dots in the explorer, a summary under Your data); a review queue (a wrong answer in the question builder or an exercise returns after 10 minutes, then 1, 3 and 7 days, through a Review button); a link for every section and tab, working back and forward buttons and a Copy link button; copy buttons beside code blocks and the Playground; a note for every concept; a print style and a Cheat sheet view; Yes / No / Report-an-error marks under every agent answer, copied out from Your data; Code exercises generated from the chapter's executed examples (put the lines in order, fill in a blank, make a program that raises an error run), each checked by running it. Resource lists for chapters 1 to 4 (14, 11, 14 and 14 links, each opened and read on 2026-09-30) and the chapter 3 Lecture tab from its deck's speaker notes (30 slides). sen0414_page_test_v9_13_0.py passed in headless Chromium on all six pages (91 to 94 checks each; no console errors; WCAG 2 AA clean); the stale-result fixture (every stored output altered) was run for all six. Page ABoxes as new files (1.4.0 for chapters 1 to 4, 1.2.0 for chapters 5 and 6); acceptance @ Courseware: web accessibility, model provenance, assessment rigour and Bloom coverage pass, the attestation is pending, not claimed. Stage 4 gates: coverage and substance fail and hybrid chains cannot run, as before; not claimed." ; backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Checks run over the artefacts as published in sen0414-v2.38.0." ;
    backlog:verifiedByTool "08-tooling/template_patch_v9_13_0.py; 08-tooling/sen0414_page_test_v9_13_0.py in headless Chromium on all six pages; 08-tooling/ch03-page/lecture_from_notes_v1_0_0.py; the resource lists were written by model agents that opened every link" ; backlog:verifiedAt "2026-09-30T10:37:44"^^xsd:dateTime .
ex:Harness_Grow a backlog:TestHarness ; rdfs:label "Checks for Progress, review, links, notes, cheat sheet, marks and code exercises on the pages of chapters 1 to 6"@en ;
    backlog:harnessFor ex:ST_Grow_Ch05 ; backlog:harnessComplete true ; backlog:hasHarnessEvidence ex:Ev_Grow .
