ex:SC_Chapters12_15to18_20to23 a backlog:ScopeChange ;
    rdfs:label "Scope grown to the chapters the owner lifted from exclusion on 2026-10-12"@en ;
    backlog:changesScope ex:Scope ;
    backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ;
    backlog:admitsItem ex:ST_Deck_Ch12, ex:ST_Research_Ch12, ex:ST_Page_Ch12, ex:ST_Deck_Ch15, ex:ST_Research_Ch15, ex:ST_Page_Ch15, ex:ST_Deck_Ch16, ex:ST_Research_Ch16, ex:ST_Page_Ch16, ex:ST_Deck_Ch17, ex:ST_Research_Ch17, ex:ST_Page_Ch17, ex:ST_Deck_Ch18, ex:ST_Research_Ch18, ex:ST_Page_Ch18, ex:ST_Deck_Ch20, ex:ST_Research_Ch20, ex:ST_Page_Ch20, ex:ST_Deck_Ch21, ex:ST_Research_Ch21, ex:ST_Page_Ch21, ex:ST_Deck_Ch22, ex:ST_Research_Ch22, ex:ST_Page_Ch22, ex:ST_Deck_Ch23, ex:ST_Research_Ch23, ex:ST_Page_Ch23 ;
    backlog:hasScopeChangeRationale "The owner ruled on 2026-10-12 (recorded in ex:Excl_CommandLine and ex:Excl_Untaught) that chapter 12 and chapters 15-18 and 20-23 are renewed in the same chapter-by-chapter run. The boundary moved outward by nine chapters of three deliverables each; the cost is named rather than absorbed: the three counted objectives' targets rise from 16 to 25, so the mission is not reached until all twenty-five subjects have a deck, a research run and a page. Nothing was traded away; the chapters already in scope keep their order." .

ex:Executor_ClaudeCodeSession a owl:NamedIndividual , backlog:Executor_SingleAgent ;
    rdfs:label "Claude Code session - the AI-agent executor of this course package's own work"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "One non-human executing party with no standing team membership, the same identity the framework's own A-Box calls its default AI-agent Executor (DefaultExecutor); the owner approves and teaches, the session performs the build." ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <http://example.org/fixture-autofix#DefaultExecutor> .

