    backlog:hasTestSpec "RDODI Stages 1-3 for chapter 13 (Web Scraping), built by 08-tooling/sen0414_ch13_build_run_v1_0_0.py from 08-tooling/sen0414_ch13_rdodi_data_v1_0_2.py, gates re-run by the lineage session 2026-10-12T08:37:44 UTC: 42 sources, 12 findings, a taxonomy of 6 subjects, 22 mid concepts, 66 leaves and 94 document sections. Stage1.A 606 triples, Stage1.B 0 violations, Stage2.A 399 triples, Stage2.C conforms, Stage3.A 770 triples, Stage3.F 42 citations verified, Stage3.B conforms, Stage3.E coverage and subjects 95, source check 95 real-sourced; overall PASS. sen0414_rdodi_checks_v1_2_0.py 63 of 63 and HermiT consistent (reported by the building agent, not re-run by the lineage session). Whole third-party programs were run in headless Firefox and 12 corpus programs exit 0 under Python 3.14.6; eight diagrams all score 0.84 or more. Not done: no display, so the pyperclip clipboard check failed; no OpenWeather key; the browsers could not reach live https through the proxy; Chrome and Safari engines were not run. Only the Reitz story carries a photo (CC BY 3.0)." ;
