    backlog:hasTestSpec "Page 9.28.1 of chapter 13 (template 9.28.x; page-data builder 2.10.0, materials register 1.41.0, course_page_config 1.7.0). Reported by the building agent: 08-tooling/sen0414_page_test_v9_28_0.py in headless Chromium run twice with the same result: 188 features and 94 widgets, all passed, 0 failed; no console errors, 0 dialogs, 94 sections, top menu visible on mobile, axe WCAG 2 A/AA violations none, longest main-thread task 112 ms. 12 quiz items covering CO1-CO5; Lecture tab of 26 slides taken from the deck; the Lab shows the deck's five examples; 19 resource links opened with HTTP 200 on 2026-10-12; six stories with the Reitz photo credited CC BY 3.0; third-party, live and interpreter observations shown under Provenance and known limits, including what could not be verified. The research package was revised to 1.0.3 during the page build because three stored examples differ between the browser's Python 3.13.2 and 3.14.6; the lineage session re-ran the RDODI gates on 1.0.3: Stage1.A 606, Stage1.B 0 violations, Stage2.A 399, Stage2.C conforms, Stage3.A 770, Stage3.F 42 citations verified, Stage3.B conforms, Stage3.E 95, source check 95 real-sourced, overall PASS. The research evidence recorded earlier cites 1.0.2, which stays on disk. Not verified: three of the deck's five examples (status, soup, robots) do not reproduce in the page's browser Python (Pyodide 3.13.2 has no requests or bs4, and 3.13 does not read the robots wildcard), so the page shows their recorded 3.14.6 results; exam release codes were not exercised against the real instructor key (a throwaway key was used on a copy differing only in the two public-key strings); the live language model (no WebGPU), Chrome and Safari were not run; no separate pedagogy gate was run, as for chapter 12; the Courseware attestation, the owner's, is pending and not claimed. Amended 2026-10-12T10:03:30: after this record the deck was registered (materials register 1.42.0) and, because the page embeds the register, the page was rebuilt as 9.28.2 (commit 3018ec7); the page test passed again twice with 188 of 188 features and 94 of 94 widgets, 0 failed; 9.28.1 and 9.28.0 stay on disk; the shipped page is 9.28.2." ;
    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Checks run by the building agent over the page 9.28.1 committed in a9b8bcc (earlier 9.28.0 in 1a12e95 stays on disk, superseded); research gates re-run by the lineage session at the finish time on the newest research package, 1.0.3." ;
    backlog:verifiedByTool "08-tooling/sen0414_page_test_v9_28_0.py in headless Chromium (playwright 1.56.0); sen0414_rdodi_gates_v1_1_1.py (Stages 1-3) and RDODI Stage 4 checks as reported" ;
