    backlog:hasTestSpec "RDODI Stages 1-3 for chapter 14 (Excel Spreadsheets), built by 08-tooling/sen0414_ch14_build_run_v1_0_0.py from 08-tooling/sen0414_ch14_rdodi_data_v1_0_1.py: 45 sources, 14 findings, a taxonomy of 6 subjects, 21 mid concepts, 66 leaves and 93 document sections. Re-run by the lineage session: Stage1.A 646 triples, Stage1.B 0 violations, Stage2.A 395, Stage2.C conforms, Stage3.A 762, Stage3.F 45 citations verified, Stage3.B conforms, Stage3.E coverage and substance 94, source check 94 real-sourced; overall PASS. Reported by the building agent, not re-run by the lineage session: 108 execution checks with 0 mismatches and HermiT consistent; 32 third-party programs recorded with 0 differing; identical output under Python 3.14.0 to 3.14.6, 3.13 and 3.12; 12 corpus programs exit 0 (two need LibreOffice and requests); eight diagrams all at 0.84 or more; six stories whose links answered HTTP 200. Not verified: Excel itself was not available; no story photograph (Wikimedia answered 429), so none is shown; the Ecma and ISO pages were unreachable and the Library of Congress description was read instead; the pinned chapter commit was not opened; only Projects 9 and 10 ran on the real files." ;
