ex:Ev_Deck_Ch14 a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Checks for Deck Ch14"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage ;
    backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC_Chapter ; backlog:evidenceVerified true ; backlog:hasTestId "Deck/Ch14" ;
    backlog:hasTestSpec "Deck 1.0.0 of chapter 14 (Excel Spreadsheets), 26 slides with speaker notes on every slide (26 of 26, re-counted by the lineage session), built by 08-tooling/ch14-deck/build_v1_0_0.sh under Python 3.14.6 with openpyxl 3.1.5. Reported by the building agent: 14 programs recorded, all exit 0, 12 shown with their transcripts; deck_check re-ran 34 console rows, 1 chart and 1 table with 0 mismatches; program_check 12 panels, 0 mismatches; diagram_check 8 diagrams, 84 labels found verbatim, 0 mismatches, grounding 0.84 or more; structure_check 0 paragraphs PowerPoint would repair; layout clean; fit 382 text frames, 0 overflowing, 0 overlapping; links 13 of 13 answered 200. Seven stale fixtures (expression, table, chart, program, code, transcript capture, diagram) were each refused by the check that targets them, observed in the run. Not verified: no PowerPoint (LibreOffice renders only); nothing re-run in a browser; two programs on slides need requests or defusedxml folders (CH14_EXTRA) to re-run; the live program depends on the network. No photograph is shown because none exists for this chapter." ;
    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Checks run by the building agent over the deck committed in de260fa; slide and notes counts re-read by the lineage session at the finish time." ;
    backlog:verifiedByTool "08-tooling/ch14-deck: deck_check, program_check, diagram_check, links_check, structure_check and the shared layout, fit and notes checks under Python 3.14.6" ;
    backlog:verifiedAt "2026-10-12T12:16:44"^^xsd:dateTime .
