ex:Ev_Page_Ch14 a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Checks for Page Ch14"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage ;
    backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC_Chapter ; backlog:evidenceVerified true ; backlog:hasTestId "Page/Ch14" ;
    backlog:hasTestSpec "Page 9.29.0 of chapter 14 (Excel Spreadsheets), on template 9.43.0 (made for this page: it unpacks two embedded pure-Python wheels, openpyxl 3.1.5 and et_xmlfile 2.0.0, SHA-256 checked by page-data 2.12.0, so the examples run in the page's browser Python); materials register 1.43.0 (registers the deck, research document and page), course_page_config 1.9.0. Reported by the building agent: 08-tooling/sen0414_page_test_v9_28_0.py with PAGE_VER=9_29_0 in headless Chromium run twice on the final page: 188 of 188 features and 93 of 93 widgets passed, 0 failed, both runs; no console errors, 0 dialogs, 93 sections, top menu visible on mobile, axe WCAG 2 A/AA none, longest main-thread task 171 ms and 111 ms. 12 quiz items (CO1 2, CO2 3, CO3 2, CO4 2, CO5 3) whose answers were executed under Python 3.14.6 with openpyxl 3.1.5; the 60 concept examples were re-run in the browser and compared with their stored 3.14.6 values; the playground (Projects 9 and 10) and the five deck chapter-examples matched in the page; two deliberate-error examples differ from 3.14.6 only in traceback frames. The research package was revised to 1.0.2 because one stored example started a second interpreter with subprocess, which a browser cannot do; the lineage session re-ran the RDODI gates on 1.0.2: Stage1.A 646, Stage1.B 0 violations, Stage2.A 395, Stage2.C conforms, Stage3.A 762, Stage3.F 45 citations verified, Stage3.B conforms, Stage3.E 94, source check 94 real-sourced; overall PASS. The research evidence recorded earlier cites 1.0.1, which stays on disk. Not verified: exam release codes with the real instructor key (the tested copy differs only in the two public-key strings); the live language model; Chrome beyond Chromium and Safari; Excel, Google Sheets and Windows; the running time of wheel unpacking on slow devices; the Courseware attestation, the owner's, is pending and not claimed." ;
    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Checks run by the building agent over the page 9.29.0 committed in 2a2020d; research gates re-run by the lineage session on the newest research package, 1.0.2." ;
    backlog:verifiedByTool "08-tooling/sen0414_page_test_v9_28_0.py in headless Chromium (playwright 1.56.0); sen0414_rdodi_gates_v1_1_1.py (Stages 1-3) and RDODI Stage 4 checks as reported" ;
    backlog:verifiedAt "2026-10-12T14:21:17"^^xsd:dateTime .
