ex:Ev_Deck_Ch15 a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Checks for Deck Ch15"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage ;
    backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC_Chapter ; backlog:evidenceVerified true ; backlog:hasTestId "Deck/Ch15" ;
    backlog:hasTestSpec "Deck 1.0.0 of chapter 15 (Google Sheets), 26 slides with speaker notes on every slide (26 of 26, re-counted by the lineage session), built by 08-tooling/ch15-deck/build_v1_0_0.sh under Python 3.14.6 with ezsheets 2026.4.28. Reported by the building agent: 18 program panels all exit 0 and re-run equal to their transcripts; deck_check 21 console rows, 1 chart and 1 table, 0 mismatches; program_check 18 panels (16 distinct programs), 0 mismatches; diagram_check 8 diagrams, 94 labels found verbatim, 0 mismatches; structure_check 0 repairs; layout clean; fit 0 frames overflowing and 0 overlapping; links 13 of 13 answered 200; a new honesty_check requires 'Stand-in for Google' on every slide that shows a stand-in program, 'recorded fixture' on fixture programs and 'NOT EXECUTED' on exactly the slides planned, with 0 refusals. Nine stale fixtures (expression, table, chart, program, code, transcript capture, diagram, a missing stand-in label, a missing NOT EXECUTED mark) were each refused by the check that targets them. Google was never reached: 15 of the programs run the real EZSheets library against a stand-in written for the run, and the Google Cloud setup, sign-in, token expiry, USER_ENTERED parsing and quota numbers are marked NOT EXECUTED on their slides. Not verified: no PowerPoint (LibreOffice renders only); the 30 versus '30' claim on slide 14 comes from the research record, not a re-run; two diagram labels touch a box edge (cosmetic)." ;
    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Checks run by the building agent over the deck committed in 366c931; slide and notes counts re-read by the lineage session at the finish time." ;
    backlog:verifiedByTool "08-tooling/ch15-deck: deck_check, program_check, diagram_check, honesty_check, links_check, structure_check and the shared layout, fit and notes checks under Python 3.14.6" ;
    backlog:verifiedAt "2026-10-12T14:21:19"^^xsd:dateTime .
