    backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC_Chapter ; backlog:evidenceVerified true ; backlog:hasTestId "Research/Ch16" ;
    backlog:hasTestSpec "RDODI Stages 1-3 for chapter 16 (SQLite Databases), built by 08-tooling/sen0414_ch16_build_run_v1_0_0.py from 08-tooling/sen0414_ch16_rdodi_data_v1_0_2.py: 75 sources, 18 findings, a taxonomy of 6 subjects, 21 mid concepts, 73 leaves and 100 document sections. Re-run by the lineage session: Stage1.A 982 triples, Stage1.B 0 violations, Stage2.A 423, Stage2.C conforms, Stage3.A 818, Stage3.F 75 citations verified, Stage3.B conforms, Stage3.E coverage and substance 101, source check 101 real-sourced; overall PASS. Reported by the building agent, not re-run by the lineage session: 115 execution checks with 0 mismatches and HermiT consistent (71 leaf examples, 26 claims, 17 behaviours); 13 third-party programs with 0 differing; 12 corpus programs exit 0 (two read the shipped database); eight diagrams all at 0.85 or more; six stories whose links answered HTTP 200; the chapter page sha256 equals the book ontology's chapterDigest. NOT EXECUTED: the three graphical applications (DB Browser for SQLite, SQLiteStudio, DBeaver) were not installed (only their pages were opened); the Windows and macOS installers and the apt install were not run; the book's figures were not checked as drawn; the timings and the 1,000-writer run are single runs on one machine and are labelled MEASURED; the pinned chapter commit was not opened; no story photograph (Wikimedia rate-limited this environment)." ;
    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Gates run over the artefacts as committed in 49c6c02 (sen0414: chapter 16 (SQLite Databases) research package at the CME standard); the gates re-run by the lineage session at 2026-10-12T14:20:56 UTC." ;
