ex:ST_Page_Ch15 backlog:finishedAt "2026-10-12T18:32:36"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:lastAuditedAt "2026-10-12T18:32:36"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:hasEvidence ex:Ev_Page_Ch15 ; backlog:hasExecutionModality backlog:Mode_Hybrid .
ex:Ev_Page_Ch15 a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Checks for Page Ch15"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage ;
    backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC_Chapter ; backlog:evidenceVerified true ; backlog:hasTestId "Page/Ch15" ;
    backlog:hasTestSpec "Page 9.30.0 of chapter 15 (Google Sheets), on template 9.44.0, materials register 1.44.0 (registers the deck, research document and page), course_page_config 1.10.0. Reported by the building agent: the page test in headless Chromium run twice: 188 of 188 features and 95 of 95 widgets passed, 0 failed, both runs; no console errors, no dialogs, 95 sections, top menu visible on mobile, axe WCAG 2 AA none. 12 quiz items, none relying on a real Google answer, stand-in wording in the questions that need it. 61 concept examples run in the browser and match their stored output (61 of 61). The playground is stdlib only because ezsheets is not in Pyodide; the chapter examples letters, pickle, pkce and backoff match Python 3.14.6, and title prints the browser's 3.13.2 (a known difference). The real EZSheets library runs in the page from 14 embedded wheels (ezsheets is GPL-3.0-or-later, noted in ASSETS_PROVENANCE); every example that talks to the stand-in for Google is marked on the page and the Overview states that Google was never reached. The research package was revised to 1.0.2 (six examples changed for the browser's Python); the lineage session re-ran the RDODI gates on it: Stage1.A 813, Stage1.B 0 violations, Stage2.A 403, Stage2.C conforms, Stage3.A 778, Stage3.F 60 citations verified, Stage3.B conforms, Stage3.E 96, source check 96 real-sourced; overall PASS; the earlier research evidence cites 1.0.1, which stays on disk. To pass the page test the building agent also changed the shared template: the timed mock exam skips stand-in examples in predict, blank and write questions (build about 20 s instead of 128 s), and the ERD Untangle now keeps relationship labels apart; the ERD change applies to every chapter and was not re-run against chapters 13 and 14. Not verified: exam release codes with the real instructor key; the live language model; Chrome and Safari; real Google behaviour (Cloud setup, sign-in, token expiry, value parsing, quota numbers); first-start time on slow phones (about 6 s boot); the Courseware attestation, the owner's, is pending and not claimed." ;
    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Checks run by the building agent over the page 9.30.0 committed in 32b96da; research gates re-run by the lineage session on the newest research package, 1.0.2." ;
    backlog:verifiedByTool "the page test in headless Chromium (playwright 1.56.0); sen0414_rdodi_gates_v1_1_1.py (Stages 1-3) and RDODI Stage 4 checks as reported" ;
    backlog:verifiedAt "2026-10-12T18:32:36"^^xsd:dateTime .
