ex:Ev_Deck_Ch16 a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Checks for Deck Ch16"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage ;
    backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC_Chapter ; backlog:evidenceVerified true ; backlog:hasTestId "Deck/Ch16" ;
    backlog:hasTestSpec "Deck 1.0.0 of chapter 16 (SQLite Databases), 26 slides with speaker notes on every slide (26 of 26, re-counted by the lineage session), built by 08-tooling/ch16-deck/build_v1_0_0.sh under Python 3.14.6 (sqlite3 linked to SQLite 3.53.1). Reported by the building agent: 15 programs run, all exit 0 (the 12 corpus programs plus 3 deck-written copies; 4 read the shipped sweigartcats.db, marked LIVE); deck_check 70 console rows, 1 chart and 1 table re-run, 0 mismatches; program_check 13 panels (12 distinct programs), 0 mismatches; diagram_check 8 diagrams, 87 labels found verbatim, 0 mismatches; structure_check 0 repairs; layout clean; fit 374 frames, 0 overflowing, 0 overlapping; honesty_check 0 refusals (slide 23 marked NOT EXECUTED, measured timings on slides 7, 15 and 18 say single run); links 13 of 13 answered 200. Ten stale fixtures (expression, table, chart, program, code, transcript capture, diagram, missing database-hash line, missing NOT EXECUTED mark, missing single-run label) were each refused by the check that targets them. The 70 console rows were also run in Pyodide 0.28.3 under Node: 65 match, 5 differ because it runs Python 3.13.2 with SQLite 3.39.0 (the two version rows, PRAGMA max_page_count, sqlite_version() and date('2035-02-30')); the deck makes no Pyodide claim. Not verified: no PowerPoint (LibreOffice renders viewed at low resolution); the sqlite3 shell, DB Browser, SQLiteStudio, DBeaver, apt and the installers were not run (shown as NOT EXECUTED); timings are single runs; the build needs the network once for the LIVE programs and links." ;
    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Checks run by the building agent over the deck committed in 513fdb1; slide and notes counts re-read by the lineage session at the finish time." ;
    backlog:verifiedByTool "08-tooling/ch16-deck: deck_check, program_check, diagram_check, honesty_check, links_check, structure_check and the shared layout, fit and notes checks under Python 3.14.6" ;
    backlog:verifiedAt "2026-10-12T18:32:38"^^xsd:dateTime .
