ex:Ev_Page_Ch16 a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Checks for Page Ch16"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage ;
    backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC_Chapter ; backlog:evidenceVerified true ; backlog:hasTestId "Page/Ch16" ;
    backlog:hasTestSpec "Page 9.31.0 of chapter 16 (SQLite Databases), on template 9.45.0 (new file; 9.44.0 untouched, so pages 13-15 are unaffected), materials register 1.45.0 (registers the deck, research document and page), course_page_config 1.11.0. Reported by the building agent: the page test in headless Chromium run twice: 187 of 187 features and 100 of 100 widgets passed, 0 failed, both runs; no console errors, no dialogs, 100 sections, top menu visible on mobile. 12 quiz items kept from the earlier build and re-read against the research; 69 concept examples run in the browser and match their stored results (69 of 69); the playground (meal ingredients) gives the same transcript as Python 3.14.6; of the eight deck chapter-examples five match 3.14.6 and three (title, connect, values) print different versions or a different date('2035-02-30') and say so in a note; the browser runs Python 3.13.2 with SQLite 3.39.0. The research package was revised to 1.0.3 so eight stored examples give the same result in both environments (one also leaked a shared-cache memory database between runs); the lineage session re-ran the RDODI gates on it: Stage1.A 982, Stage1.B 0 violations, Stage2.A 423, Stage2.C conforms, Stage3.A 818, Stage3.F 75 citations verified, Stage3.B conforms, Stage3.E 101, source check 101 real-sourced; overall PASS; the earlier research evidence cites 1.0.2, which stays on disk. The page embeds the 24,576-byte shipped sweigartcats.db (SHA-256 starting 41f0d0b5bc2e) and writes it to the browser's temporary folder at start; the online-materials zip carries no licence file, so redistribution of that file is an open question for the owner (the file and its page entries are the only things to remove). SqliteCli and PythonShell start another program, which a browser cannot do; they are shown as recorded, not run. Not verified: exam release codes with the real instructor key; the live language model; Chrome and Safari; the graphical database tools, the Windows and macOS installers and apt install; first-start time on slow phones; the Courseware attestation, the owner's, is pending and not claimed." ;
    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Checks run by the building agent over the page 9.31.0 committed in 16fc898; research gates re-run by the lineage session on the newest research package, 1.0.3." ;
    backlog:verifiedByTool "the page test in headless Chromium (playwright 1.56.0); sen0414_rdodi_gates_v1_1_1.py (Stages 1-3) and RDODI Stage 4 checks as reported" ;
    backlog:verifiedAt "2026-10-12T20:22:40"^^xsd:dateTime .
