ex:Ev_Deck_Ch17 a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Checks for Deck Ch17"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage ;
    backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC_Chapter ; backlog:evidenceVerified true ; backlog:hasTestId "Deck/Ch17" ;
    backlog:hasTestSpec "Deck 1.0.0 of chapter 17 (PDF and Word Documents), 26 slides with speaker notes on every slide (26 of 26, re-counted by the lineage session), built by 08-tooling/ch17-deck/build_v1_0_0.sh under Python 3.14.6 with pypdf 6.20.1 and python-docx 1.2.0. Reported by the building agent: 27 programs ran (12 corpus programs and 15 deck copies), all exit 0, including recordings with only pypdf and with docx 0.2.4; deck_check 32 console rows, 1 chart and 1 table re-run, 0 mismatches; program_check 19 panels (15 distinct programs), 0 mismatches; diagram_check 8 diagrams, 93 labels found verbatim, 0 mismatches; structure_check 0 repairs; layout 377 frames 0 overflowing 0 overlapping; fit clean; honesty_check 0 refusals (slides 8 and 23 marked NOT EXECUTED, slide 16 timings marked single run); links 13 of 13 opened. Ten stale fixtures (expression, table, chart, program, code, transcript capture, diagram, missing fetched-file hash, missing NOT EXECUTED mark, missing single-run label) were each refused by the check that targets them. NOT EXECUTED and marked so on the slides: the AI clean-up (slide 8) and Microsoft Word and a PDF viewer (slide 23). Not verified: no PowerPoint (LibreOffice renders only); no browser Python run (most consoles need pypdf, python-docx or Pillow); the build needs the network once for the two shipped files; the building agent did not re-check every note against the research package; some deck copies of programs were shortened to fit panels and are verified only by being run (the subset checks pass for two of them); slide 15 hides lines 1 to 26 and says so." ;
    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Checks run by the building agent over the deck committed in e54e4d1; slide and notes counts re-read by the lineage session at the finish time." ;
    backlog:verifiedByTool "08-tooling/ch17-deck: deck_check, program_check, diagram_check, honesty_check, links_check, structure_check and the shared layout, fit and notes checks under Python 3.14.6" ;
    backlog:verifiedAt "2026-10-12T20:22:42"^^xsd:dateTime .
