ex:Ev_Research_Ch18 a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Checks for Research Ch18"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage ;
    backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC_Chapter ; backlog:evidenceVerified true ; backlog:hasTestId "Research/Ch18" ;
    backlog:hasTestSpec "RDODI Stages 1-3 for chapter 18 (CSV, JSON, and XML Files), built by 08-tooling/sen0414_ch18_build_run_v1_0_0.py from 08-tooling/sen0414_ch18_rdodi_data_v1_0_2.py: 64 sources (all HTTP 200 with their phrases found), 18 findings, a taxonomy of 6 subjects, 21 mid concepts, 68 leaves and 95 document sections. Re-run by the lineage session: Stage1.A 739 triples, Stage1.B 0 violations, Stage2.A 403, Stage2.C conforms, Stage3.A 778, Stage3.F 64 citations verified, Stage3.B conforms, Stage3.E coverage and substance 96, source check 96 real-sourced; overall PASS. Reported by the building agent, not re-run by the lineage session: 105 execution checks with 0 mismatches and HermiT consistent; 37 third-party programs re-run with 0 differing; 11 interpreters compared on 50 items; 12 corpus programs exit 0 under 3.14.6, each writing its own files; eight diagrams all above 0.84; six stories whose links answered HTTP 200; the replay of the chapter's 97 statements. NOT EXECUTED or substituted: Microsoft Excel (LibreOffice 24.2.7.2 stood in); a real Windows machine (the CRLF double-spacing was emulated with io.TextIOWrapper); Python 3.14.7, 3.14.8 and 3.15.0 final (uv offers up to 3.14.6 and 3.15.0b4); the language-model clean-up step; the Practice Program as readers would write it; the corpus programs ran on generated files, not on the shipped zip; no story photograph (Wikimedia answered 429); GitHub pages answered 403 and the site's cover images 404." ;
    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Gates run over the artefacts as committed in 6a80111 (sen0414: chapter 18 (CSV, JSON, and XML Files) research package at the CME standard); the gates re-run by the lineage session at 2026-10-12T20:22:14 UTC." ;
    backlog:verifiedByTool "08-tooling/sen0414_rdodi_gates_v1_1_1.py (rdodi-ecosystem/02-gates/rdodi_pipeline_validator_v1_6_0.py, Stages 1-3), sen0414_rdodi_checks_v1_2_0.py (Python 3.14.x; HermiT)" ;
    backlog:verifiedAt "2026-10-12T20:22:44"^^xsd:dateTime .
