ex:Ev_Page_Ch17 a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Checks for Page Ch17"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage ;
    backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC_Chapter ; backlog:evidenceVerified true ; backlog:hasTestId "Page/Ch17" ;
    backlog:hasTestSpec "Page 9.32.0 of chapter 17 (PDF and Word Documents), on template 9.46.0 (new file, builder 4.14.0; earlier templates untouched so pages 13-16 are unaffected), materials register 1.46.0 (registers the deck, research document and page), course_page_config 1.12.0. Reported by the building agent: the page test in headless Chromium run twice: 376 checks passed and 0 failed in each run; no console errors, no dialogs, 95 sections, top menu visible on mobile, axe WCAG 2 AA none. 11 quiz items. pypdf 6.20.1 (BSD-3-Clause) and python-docx 1.2.0 (MIT) are embedded as hash-checked wheels, licences in ASSETS_PROVENANCE, and run on Pyodide 0.28.2 (CPython 3.13.2) with its own lxml, Pillow and cryptography; all 68 concept examples give a result identical to the stored one; the playground matches Python 3.14.6; the blank exercises were checked three times with 0 bad of 56. The template change in 9.46.0: blank and vary questions skip code inside def blocks, import lines and the exec wrapper's closing, and the tab rows above a chapter's sections sit closer together. The research package was revised to 1.0.2 (four examples changed so the browser matches 3.14.6; pdfminer is stated as recorded because it is not embedded) and the building agent also added one sentence to the second paragraph of eight leaves, each naming a leaf in another section, so the entity-relationship view had a third connected entity (relations are now 98, 89 stated and 9 co-mentions); the sentences add no figures. The lineage session re-ran the RDODI gates on 1.0.2: Stage1.A 842, Stage1.B 0 violations, Stage2.A 403, Stage2.C conforms, Stage3.A 778, Stage3.F 52 citations verified, Stage3.B conforms, Stage3.E 96, source check 96 real-sourced; overall PASS; the research evidence recorded earlier cites 1.0.1, which stays on disk. Recorded and labelled, not run: the pdfminer alternative, the optional AES dependency, the Password Breaker worst cases (single runs), and the deck's NOT EXECUTED items (Microsoft Word, PDF viewers, AI clean-up). The title example differs in interpreter and library versions between browser and 3.14.6 and says so. No shipped book file is embedded. Not verified: exam release codes with the real instructor key; the live language model; Chrome and Safari; real Word and PDF viewers; first-start time on slow phones; the Courseware attestation, the owner's, is pending and not claimed." ;
    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Checks run by the building agent over the page 9.32.0 committed in 9f91879; research gates re-run by the lineage session on the newest research package, 1.0.2." ;
    backlog:verifiedByTool "the page test in headless Chromium (playwright 1.56.0); sen0414_rdodi_gates_v1_1_1.py (Stages 1-3) and RDODI Stage 4 checks as reported" ;
    backlog:verifiedAt "2026-10-12T23:40:43"^^xsd:dateTime .
