ex:Ev_Deck_Ch18 a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Checks for Deck Ch18"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage ;
    backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC_Chapter ; backlog:evidenceVerified true ; backlog:hasTestId "Deck/Ch18" ;
    backlog:hasTestSpec "Deck 1.0.0 of chapter 18 (CSV, JSON, and XML Files), 26 slides with speaker notes on every slide (26 of 26, re-counted by the lineage session), built by 08-tooling/ch18-deck/build_v1_0_0.sh under Python 3.14.6 with xmltodict 1.0.4 and defusedxml 0.7.1. Reported by the building agent: 28 programs ran (12 corpus programs and 16 deck cuts), all exit 0; deck_check 25 console rows, 1 chart and 2 tables re-computed, 0 mismatches; program_check 18 panels (16 distinct programs), 0 mismatches; diagram_check 8 diagrams, 87 labels found verbatim, 0 mismatches; structure_check 0 repairs; layout clean; fit 373 frames, 0 overflowing, 0 overlapping; honesty_check 0 refusals (slides 10 and 13 marked NOT EXECUTED, slide 10 marked EMULATED, slide 7 times marked single run); links 14 opened, 0 failing. Eleven stale fixtures (expression, table, chart, program, code, transcript capture, diagram, missing NOT EXECUTED mark, missing single-run label, missing EMULATED mark, a NOT EXECUTED claim not in the plan) were each refused by the check that targets them. NOT EXECUTED or emulated and marked so on the slides: Excel itself, a real Windows machine (CRLF behaviour emulated with TextIOWrapper), Python 3.14.7+ and 3.15 final, and the language-model clean-up. Not verified: no PowerPoint (LibreOffice and pdftoppm previews only); consoles not tried in a browser Python (the tracemalloc, xmltodict and defusedxml programs probably will not reproduce there); the memory figures on slide 7 are single runs; four of the six stories are in the speaker notes only." ;
    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Checks run by the building agent over the deck committed in dae37a4; slide and notes counts re-read by the lineage session at the finish time." ;
    backlog:verifiedByTool "08-tooling/ch18-deck: deck_check, program_check, diagram_check, honesty_check, links_check, structure_check and the shared layout, fit and notes checks under Python 3.14.6" ;
    backlog:verifiedAt "2026-10-12T23:40:45"^^xsd:dateTime .
