ex:Ev_Page_Ch18 a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Checks for Page Ch18"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage ;
    backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC_Chapter ; backlog:evidenceVerified true ; backlog:hasTestId "Page/Ch18" ;
    backlog:hasTestSpec "Page 9.33.0 of chapter 18 (CSV, JSON, and XML Files), on template 9.47.0 (new file, builder 4.15.0, page test 9.29.0; earlier templates untouched so pages 13-17 are unaffected), materials register 1.47.0 (registers the deck, research document and page, and corrects the research file names given as _1_0_N instead of _v1_0_N in the chapter 15-17 entries of 1.45.0 and 1.46.0 without editing those files), course_page_config 1.13.0. Reported by the building agent: the page test in headless Chromium run twice: 374 passed, 0 failed, 2 skipped in each run; no console errors, no dialogs, 95 sections, top menu visible on mobile, axe WCAG 2 AA none. THE TWO SKIPS: the research states 89 relations and every one joins a concept to its section or a section to its subject, so the sections entity-relationship view has 21 entities and no lines; the test (9.29.0) skips the two line-dependent ERD checks for that reason rather than the research text being altered. 11 quiz items. 66 of 68 concept examples give a result identical to the stored one in the browser; the other two (DefaultEncodingIsLocale, SerializationErrorNotes) are shown recorded and labelled, not run, with their 3.14.6 output. The six deck chapter-examples ran in the browser: title prints 3.13.2 instead of 3.14.6, and appb and limits stop at the first error, each with a note. xmltodict 1.0.4 (MIT), defusedxml 0.7.1 (PSFL), openpyxl 3.1.5 and et_xmlfile 2.0.0 (MIT) are embedded as hash-checked wheels with licences in ASSETS_PROVENANCE; lxml comes from Pyodide. Memory and time figures are labelled MEASURED single runs. The deck's NOT EXECUTED and EMULATED labels are reproduced (Excel, a real Windows machine with CRLF emulated by TextIOWrapper, Python 3.14.7+ and 3.15 final, the language-model clean-up). Template 9.47.0 keeps breadcrumb concept pills on one row with sideways scrolling; test 9.29.0 also asks the builder for a varied code question when the seeded sample has none. Page 17 was not re-run under test 9.29.0. Not verified: exam release codes with the real instructor key; the live language model; Chrome and Safari; real Excel, Windows and later Python releases; first-start time on slow phones; the two skipped ERD-line checks; the Courseware attestation, the owner's, is pending and not claimed." ;
    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Checks run by the building agent over the page 9.33.0 committed in e1462d8; research left at 1.0.2, so the gates already re-run for chapter 18 apply (re-run again by the lineage session at the finish time)." ;
    backlog:verifiedByTool "the page test in headless Chromium (playwright 1.56.0); sen0414_rdodi_gates_v1_1_1.py (Stages 1-3) and RDODI Stage 4 checks as reported" ;
    backlog:verifiedAt "2026-10-13T06:56:50"^^xsd:dateTime .
