ex:Ev_Deck_Ch19 a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Checks for Deck Ch19"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage ;
    backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC_Chapter ; backlog:evidenceVerified true ; backlog:hasTestId "Deck/Ch19" ;
    backlog:hasTestSpec "Deck 1.0.0 of chapter 19 (Keeping Time, Scheduling Tasks, and Launching Programs), 26 slides with speaker notes on every slide (26 of 26, re-counted by the lineage session), built by 08-tooling/ch19-deck/build_v1_0_0.sh under Python 3.14.6 with tzdata 2026.5. Reported by the building agent: 30 recorded programs (12 corpus programs and 18 cuts), all exit 0; deck_check 25 console rows, 1 chart and 2 tables re-run with 0 mismatches (no row reads the clock); program_check 21 panels (18 distinct programs), 0 mismatches; diagram_check 8 diagrams, 87 labels found verbatim, 0 mismatches; structure_check 0 repairs; layout clean; fit 377 frames, 0 overflowing, 0 overlapping; honesty_check 0 refusals (4 slides NOT EXECUTED: 13, 19, 21, 22; 4 slides EMULATED: 6, 8, 20, 22; slide 9 single run); links 14 opened, 0 failures. Eleven stale fixtures (expression, table, chart, program, code, transcript capture, diagram, and missing NOT EXECUTED, single-run and EMULATED marks, and a NOT EXECUTED claim not in the plan) were each refused by the check that targets them. NOT EXECUTED and marked on the slides: Python 3.14.7+ and 3.15.0 final; Windows and macOS commands and desktop launching; Task Scheduler, launchd and a systemd timer; audible sound. Time-dependent output uses the research's fixed recorded runs. Not verified: no PowerPoint and the building agent did not render the deck through LibreOffice either, so no slide was viewed as drawn; no browser-Python check of the console rows; the lecture export links 22 of 26 slides to a concept; the closing slide's notes say the programs use no network, which was not confirmed for every corpus program; the build is not byte-reproducible (a rebuild stamps new metadata)." ;
    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Checks run by the building agent over the deck committed in 981b56c; slide and notes counts re-read by the lineage session at the finish time." ;
    backlog:verifiedByTool "08-tooling/ch19-deck: deck_check, program_check, diagram_check, honesty_check, links_check, structure_check and the shared layout, fit and notes checks under Python 3.14.6" ;
    backlog:verifiedAt "2026-10-13T06:56:52"^^xsd:dateTime .
