ex:Ev_Deck_Ch20 a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Checks for Deck Ch20"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage ;
    backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC_Chapter ; backlog:evidenceVerified true ; backlog:hasTestId "Deck/Ch20" ;
    backlog:hasTestSpec "Deck 1.0.0 of chapter 20 (Sending Email, Texts, and Push Notifications), 26 slides with speaker notes on every slide (26 of 26, re-counted by the lineage session), built by 08-tooling/ch20-deck/build_v1_0_0.sh under Python 3.14.6 with ezgmail 2026.4.28, requests 2.34.2 and aiosmtpd 1.4.6. Reported by the building agent: 31 programs ran (12 corpus programs and 19 cuts), all exit 0; deck_check 22 console rows, 1 chart and 1 table re-run with 0 mismatches (the table runs five interpreters at check time); program_check 19 panels, 0 mismatches; diagram_check 8 diagrams, 91 labels found verbatim; layout 0 frames overflowing or overlapping; fit 0 overflowing; structure_check 0 repairs; honesty_check 0 refusals; links 12 opened, all 200. Thirteen stale fixtures (expression, table, chart, program, code, transcript capture, diagram, and missing NOT EXECUTED, Gmail stand-in, local stand-in, recorded and title labels, and a NOT EXECUTED claim not in the plan) were each refused by the check that targets them. Stand-in labels are on slides 5, 6, 7, 8, 12, 13, 18, 19, 20 and 22; NOT EXECUTED on slides 5, 6, 8, 14, 15, 16, 17, 18, 20 and 23; the title slide says Gmail, a phone and ntfy were never reached. DISCREPANCIES FOUND WITH THE COMMITTED RESEARCH TEXT (finding F13 and a story), shown correctly on slide 15: the research dates the TLS 1.2 minimum of create_default_context() to Python 3.13, but the run shows 3.11.17 already at TLS 1.2 and the documentation dates it to 3.10, with 3.13 adding the two verify flags; and the DNS count is 13 of 18 gateway domains with mail exchangers, not the story text's '12 of the other 16'. The research package for chapter 20 therefore still carries those two statements and needs a correcting version. The building agent viewed LibreOffice renders of slides 1, 2, 4, 5, 7, 9, 12, 14, 15, 16, 20, 21, 22, 23, 24 and 26 (legible; on slide 23 the two decision hexagons touch); slides 3, 6, 8, 10, 11, 13, 17, 18, 19 and 25 were not viewed. Not verified: no PowerPoint; no browser-Python check of the consoles; the recorded results of 13 Oct 2026 are reproduced from the research package, not re-run; several program panels were shortened and some findings stay only in the corpus programs and notes (marked 'longer run, not on the slide')." ;
    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Checks run by the building agent over the deck committed in 966567f; slide and notes counts re-read by the lineage session at the finish time." ;
    backlog:verifiedByTool "08-tooling/ch20-deck: deck_check, program_check, diagram_check, honesty_check, links_check, structure_check and the shared layout, fit and notes checks under Python 3.14.6" ;
    backlog:verifiedAt "2026-10-13T10:24:36"^^xsd:dateTime .
