    backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC_Chapter ; backlog:evidenceVerified true ; backlog:hasTestId "Research/Ch21" ;
    backlog:hasTestSpec "RDODI Stages 1-3 for chapter 21 (Making Graphs and Manipulating Images), built by 08-tooling/sen0414_ch21_build_run_v1_0_0.py from 08-tooling/sen0414_ch21_rdodi_data_v1_0_2.py: 60 sources (all HTTP 200, every relied-on passage found), 16 findings, a taxonomy of 6 subjects, 20 mid concepts, 63 leaves and 89 document sections. Re-run by the lineage session: Stage1.A 773 triples, Stage1.B 0 violations, Stage2.A 379, Stage2.C conforms, Stage3.A 730, Stage3.F 60 citations verified, Stage3.B conforms, Stage3.E coverage and substance 90, source check 90 real-sourced; overall PASS. Reported by the building agent, not re-run by the lineage session: 78 execution checks with 0 mismatches and HermiT consistent; the chapter page sha256 equals the book ontology's chapterDigest; every number in the 16 findings also appears in the section text that teaches it, checked after the last text edit; 12 corpus programs exit 0 (four fetch the book's zip and hash-check the files; one runs the real xclip on a virtual X display); eight diagrams all at 0.917 or more; six stories whose links answered HTTP 200; 11 interpreters and 35 items with no differences (Pillow across 14 releases, Matplotlib across 14 runs); the replay of 25 interactive listings and 138 statements (matched headless / with a display: latest 131 / 135, pins 125 / 108, pins on 3.13 129 / 108); the third-party re-run reports 15 items with no differences after the comparison was changed to ignore memory addresses, process numbers and temporary folder names (the recorded outputs themselves are unchanged). NOT EXECUTED: Windows, macOS and any real screen (all window and clipboard work ran on a virtual X display); Matplotlib 3.9.2 and 3.10.0 under Python 3.14.6 (no wheel; 3.9.2 only built from source for the pins environment); no story photograph (Wikimedia answered 429), so nothing is claimed about licences; everything else not run is marked NOT EXECUTED in the records." ;
    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Gates run over the artefacts as committed in d834798 (sen0414: chapter 21 (Making Graphs and Manipulating Images) research package at the CME standard); the gates re-run by the lineage session at 2026-10-13T10:24:09 UTC." ;
