ex:Ev_Research_Ch22 a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Checks for Research Ch22"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage ;
    backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC_Chapter ; backlog:evidenceVerified true ; backlog:hasTestId "Research/Ch22" ;
    backlog:hasTestSpec "RDODI Stages 1-3 for chapter 22 (Recognizing Text in Images), built by 08-tooling/sen0414_ch22_build_run_v1_0_0.py from 08-tooling/sen0414_ch22_rdodi_data_v1_0_2.py: 53 sources (all HTTP 200, every relied-on phrase found), 19 findings, a taxonomy of 6 subjects, 21 mid concepts, 73 leaves and 100 document sections. Re-run by the lineage session: Stage1.A 660 triples, Stage1.B 0 violations, Stage2.A 423, Stage2.C conforms, Stage3.A 818, Stage3.F 53 citations verified, Stage3.B conforms, Stage3.E coverage and substance 101, source check 101 real-sourced; overall PASS. Reported by the building agent, not re-run by the lineage session: 91 execution checks with 0 mismatches and HermiT consistent; the comparison of findings with section text re-run after the last text edit reports no missing figures; 12 corpus programs exit 0 (ocrscreenOnXvfb is a local stand-in on a virtual display, not a real screen); eight diagrams all at 0.84 or more; six stories whose links answered HTTP 200; the replay of the chapter's 22 listing statements in 9 configurations (21 match with Tesseract 5.5.3 and all languages, 18 on Python 3.13.14 with the book's pins, 8 on 3.14.6, 0 in an empty Python); 19 items identical on 11 interpreters and 9 identical on 14 Pillow releases; accuracy figures are labelled MEASURED single runs with the Tesseract version named. NOT EXECUTED: Windows and macOS installers, Homebrew and the NAPS2 Flatpak; the UB Mannheim installer page (403); a flatbed scanner; the language-model step (no key, no local model); a real screen or browser (a virtual display stood in); Python 3.15 final (only 3.15.0b4); the pinned book commit; the text of the PDF embedded in Figure 22-2; pytesseract 0.3.4, 0.3.7 and 0.3.8 (source-only, not run); the best-versus-fast language-pack claims beyond English and Japanese; the earlier-recorded tessdata commit was not re-checked; the shipped dictionary.txt is not a usable word list so the spell-check claim uses /usr/share/dict/words (104,334 words); no story photograph (Wikimedia answered 429). 53 sources is under the 40-plus target's usual 60-plus of the later chapters but meets it." ;
    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Gates run over the artefacts as committed in 96f1275 (sen0414: chapter 22 (Recognizing Text in Images) research package at the CME standard) against the RDODI ecosystem pinned at commit 89f68596 (the ecosystem has since been restructured upstream); the gates re-run by the lineage session at 2026-10-13T13:54:52 UTC." ;
    backlog:verifiedByTool "08-tooling/sen0414_rdodi_gates_v1_1_1.py (rdodi-ecosystem/02-gates/rdodi_pipeline_validator_v1_6_0.py, Stages 1-3, ecosystem pinned at 89f68596), sen0414_rdodi_checks_v1_2_0.py (Python 3.14.x; HermiT)" ;
    backlog:verifiedAt "2026-10-13T13:55:13"^^xsd:dateTime .
