ex:Ev_Page_Ch21 a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "Checks for Page Ch21"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage ;
    backlog:attestsCriterion ex:AC_Chapter ; backlog:evidenceVerified true ; backlog:hasTestId "Page/Ch21" ;
    backlog:hasTestSpec "Page 9.35.0 of chapter 21 (Making Graphs and Manipulating Images), on template 9.49.0 (new file, cumulative on 9.48.0: a paragraph can carry a picture, figure and caption, with a small block of CSS; earlier pages keep their own templates) and test 9.32.0 (new file: the follow-up question put to an agent is the first of three candidates that shares no word with the concept labels, because the labels 'Drawing example' and 'Show viewer' made the old questions look like new questions; the three assertions are unchanged), builder 4.17.0, page-data 2.19.0; materials register 1.50.0 (registers the deck, research document and page), course_page_config 1.16.0. Reported by the building agent: the page test in headless Chromium run twice: 376 passed, 0 failed, 0 skipped in each run; 89 knowledge-graph widgets tested and passed; no console errors, 0 dialogs, 89 sections, top menu visible on mobile, axe WCAG 2 AA none. 11 quiz items covering CO1 to CO6, every answer run under Python 3.14.6 (Pillow 12.3.0, Matplotlib 3.11.2). 61 examples: 30 run in the browser (Pillow 11.3.0, Matplotlib 3.8.4 in Pyodide) and their results are identical by value to the stored 3.14.6 results; 31 are shown 'Recorded, not run on this page' with the reason (19 need the book's zip, which is not embedded; 2 need a TrueType font; 1 an image viewer; 1 a child process; 2 the clipboard and a virtual display; 1 the Tk 9 version check; 5 print something that differs between the recording's libraries and the browser's). The seven chapter examples run, four with a note, and the window example prints 'agg' with a warning; the playground is an offline Pillow program printing pixel values. Ten recorded deck pictures are shown beside their concepts labelled 'Recorded picture, not made on this page', hash-checked when the page is built; all decode in Chromium and one was viewed in a screenshot. The deck's labels are reproduced (NOT EXECUTED slides 11, 14, 19, 21, 22, 23; Recorded 4, 17, 20, 21; virtual display 19). No research prose was added or reworded and no example had to change. OPEN LICENCE QUESTION for the owner: the licence of the book's zip, the cat picture and the logo is not established; none is embedded on the page (the deck uses them for teaching only), and the Pillow and Matplotlib licence entries in ASSETS_PROVENANCE come from the building agent's reading of the upstream projects and should be re-checked. Known nit: the recorded bar-chart picture's caption names Pillow 12.3.0 although the picture came from Matplotlib. Not verified: exam release codes with the real instructor key; the live language model; Chrome and Safari; Windows and macOS; Python 3.14.7+ and 3.15 final; a real display; earlier pages under template 9.49.0 and test 9.32.0; the Courseware attestation, the owner's, is pending and not claimed." ;
    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Checks run by the building agent over the page 9.35.0 committed in 62f21d1; the research package is unchanged at 1.0.2, whose gates were re-run for chapter 21 at the Research record." ;
    backlog:verifiedByTool "the page test in headless Chromium (playwright 1.56.0); sen0414_rdodi_gates_v1_1_1.py (Stages 1-3) and RDODI Stage 4 checks as reported" ;
    backlog:verifiedAt "2026-10-13T21:37:50"^^xsd:dateTime .
