    backlog:hasTestSpec "Page 9.35.0 of chapter 22 (Recognizing Text in Images), template 9.49.0, builder 4.17.0, test 9.32.0, page-data 2.20.0, course_page_config 1.17.0, materials register 1.51.0. Reported by the building agent: page test in headless Chromium run twice: 376 passed, 0 failed, 0 skipped each run; 100 knowledge-graph widgets tested and passed; no console errors, 0 dialogs, 100 sections, top menu visible on mobile, axe WCAG 2 AA none; gates against the pinned ecosystem still OVERALL PASS and the checks script 91 checks 0 mismatches. 11 quiz items CO1-CO5. 73 examples: 7 run in the browser and match the stored 3.14.6 results; 66 shown 'Recorded, not run on this page' with reasons (book zip, started programs, research-machine language files, differing outputs, fonts plus Tesseract). Deck labels reproduced (NOT EXECUTED slides 7, 15, 19, 22, 23; Recorded 4, 7, 12, 23; virtual display slide 22). Seven recorded deck pictures embedded, hash-checked, drawn from the study's own text. Re-read by the lineage session: commit 5f8b62b exists on main and the page file is present (2.4 MB); the page test was not re-run by the lineage session. OPEN LICENCE QUESTIONS for the owner: the book's zip and the other seven deck pictures (not embedded); fonts used in the pictures (DejaVu, Nimbus, Z003, IPAGothic); the Pillow, NumPy, packaging licence entries are the agent's reading and should be re-checked. Not verified: exam release with the real key; live LLM; Chrome and Safari; Windows and macOS; Python 3.14.7+/3.15; a real display; earlier pages under template 9.49.0; the Courseware attestation, the owner's, pending and not claimed." ;
