    backlog:hasTestSpec "Chapter 24 (Text-to-Speech and Speech Recognition Engines) RDODI Stages 1-3. Re-run by the lineage session against the pinned ecosystem 89f68596: Stage1.A 918 triples, Stage2.A 439, Stage3.A 850, Stage3.F all claims cited and 69 citations verified, Stage3.src 105 real-sourced 0 invalid, OVERALL PASS. Reported by the building agent: 69 sources, 27 findings, checks script 94 checks 0 mismatches, HermiT consistent, 7 diagrams. NOT EXECUTED: sound playback, microphone, GPU/CUDA, Windows SAPI5 and macOS NSSpeechSynthesizer, cloud services, faster-whisper, whisper.cpp, SpeechRecognition, gTTS, Vosk (documentation read only), YouTube downloads (metadata only; archive.org public-domain audio stands in), Whisper medium/turbo (killed by memory limit), large-v3 (does not load), pinned releases that do not install, crashing pyttsx3 releases. Single runs on 2026-10-14, Ubuntu 24.04, 2 vCPU. Stated deviations: section bodies are less hand-written than chapter 23's; Whisper temperature fallback makes some texts vary; a background agent shared the machine during some runs (an early loaded-machine value was found and regenerated)." ;
    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "Gates re-run by the lineage session over the research package committed in b9ccd79 (v1_0_2)." ;
    backlog:verifiedByTool "08-tooling/sen0414_rdodi_gates_v1_1_1.py (rdodi-ecosystem/02-gates/rdodi_pipeline_validator_v1_6_0.py, Stages 1-3, ecosystem pinned at 89f68596), sen0414_rdodi_checks_v1_2_0.py (Python 3.14.x; HermiT)" ;
    backlog:verifiedAt "2026-10-14T00:42:32"^^xsd:dateTime .
ex:Harness_Research_Ch24 a backlog:TestHarness ; rdfs:label "Checks for Research Ch24"@en ; backlog:harnessFor ex:ST_Research_Ch24 ; backlog:harnessComplete true ; backlog:hasHarnessEvidence ex:Ev_Research_Ch24 .
ex:Complete_Research_Ch24 a backlog:TransitionEvent ; rdfs:label "Research Ch24 completed"@en ; backlog:transitionedItem ex:ST_Research_Ch24 ;
    backlog:viaTransition backlog:T_Complete ; backlog:transitionedAt "2026-10-14T00:42:32"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:transitionedBy backlog:Owner ;
    backlog:hasTransitionNote "Closed on Stages 1-3 of the RDODI procedure for chapter 24, planned (v2.115.0) and started (v2.118.0) in the register before the work. Everything that needs sound hardware, a microphone, a GPU, another operating system or a cloud key is recorded as not executed. The pedagogy stage runs over the page and is claimed by the chapter's page story. Times read from the clock." .
ex:Obs_Met_ResearchRecorded_Ch24 a backlog:MetricObservation ; rdfs:label "Research count read after Ch24 closed"@en ;
    backlog:observesMetric ex:Met_ResearchRecorded ; backlog:observationFor ex:Obj_ResearchRecorded ; backlog:hasObservedValue "24"^^xsd:decimal ;
    backlog:observedAt "2026-10-14T00:42:32"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:hasObservationMethod "Counted chapters whose Stages 1-3 artefacts are published in the repository's materials part and pass their gates in the repository: chapters 1-6 (recorded Done here), chapters 7-12 (built and checked, their register stories awaiting the ruling of the Backlog package, not counted from Done stories) and chapters 13 to 24" .

